Package: t-delayer-docker
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: debconf (>= 1.5), python3, systemd, docker.io | docker-ce
Maintainer: Fredrik Nilsson <fredrik@polylegio.se>
Description: Disk-based multicast delayer with a web UI in Docker
 Installs a bundled amd64 Docker image with a persistent PostgreSQL database,
 an authenticated web UI, and systemd lifecycle management.
 Configure host, bridge, or an existing Docker network using debconf.
